    <tei:body>
        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:lefikhakh">
          <tei:p>Therefore, it is our duty to give thanks to thee, to praise and glorify thee, to bless and hallow thy name, and to offer many thanksgivings to thee. Happy are we! How good is our destiny, how pleasant our lot, how beautiful our heritage!</tei:p>
